nd you that back in 2010  with barack obama and joe biden  what happened when they had the bird flu  the h1n1  they went from april to october before  they declared it a pandemic  60 million americans were infected  and while it was much less deadly  still you had americans that suffered  because  it took them six months to make up a  fund  this is the difference in a president  that takes  action and a president that wants to  move  things to committee for discussion  meantime senator let's switch gears  again  you're getting into the podcast game  with a podcast called  freedom rings tell us more about it  oh yes every time i would be across in  tennessee people would say  marcia tell me about some of the people  that are really  fighting for us so  we decided to start a podcast called  freedom  rings people can go to  freedomringspodcast.com  find out more or go to my political  website  at marsha blackburn and find out more  at vote marcia and what we have done  is to pull together some of these happy  warrior freedom fighters  you're kelly leffler senator rick scott  they're telling their stories about how  they grew up  senator people can find one more we got  to leave it there good luck with the  podcast

